# Interchouette GitHub (tvscreener-rs reminder)

Canonical always-on rule: **`~/.cursor/rules/git-remote-naming.mdc`** (applies to all repos).

Quick locks for this tree:

| Item | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Worker remotes | **`interchouette`** = Interchouette fork; **`upstream`** = Interchouette-ITC; never worker as `origin` |
| Creds | repo-local **`.github_credentials`** (`GITHUB_EMAIL` / `GITHUB_PASSWORD` / `GITHUB_TOKEN`) |

### `gh` auth (same as ITCy)

```bash
set -a && . ./.github_credentials && set +a && export GH_TOKEN="$GITHUB_TOKEN"
```

- Stale `~/.config/gh/hosts.yml` is fine. Export `GH_TOKEN` and call `gh`.
- **Never** `gh auth login` / `--with-token` / `refresh` / `logout` (triggers Smart Mode approval loops).
- Do **not** ask Greg to approve login.
- Do **not** print tokens.
